{"id": "golden-gate-park-tennis-rent", "title": "Golden Gate Park tennis operator underpaid rent by $10,593", "seconds": 80.9, "voice": "elevenlabs:OtHu0lbpdNTqJVqaxDtR", "narrator": "Maven", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "8f380b635e4ee0ad", "words": 253, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["amount", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "How much rent did the Golden Gate Park Tennis Center owe the City?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 3.63, "shot": "r0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["A", "tennis", "center’s", "rent"], "sub": "Golden Gate Park"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.39, 0.66, 0.79, 0.89, 1.16, 1.36, 1.6, 1.9, 2.21, 2.34, 2.45]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "The auditors checked operations from March 2021 through March 2023.", "t0": 3.63, "t1": 7.66, "shot": "r1", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "timeline", "context": "Audit period", "heading": "Tennis center operations", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "calendar", "label": "Audit began", "event": "2021-03-03"}, {"icon": "calendar", "label": "Audit period ended", "event": "2023-03-31"}]}, "wt": [0.04, 0.22, 0.66, 0.92, 1.5, 1.7, 1.97, 2.24, 2.73, 2.97, 3.2, 3.44]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "Lifetime Tennis operated the center under an agreement with Recreation and Park.", "t0": 7.78, "t1": 11.49, "shot": "r2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office", "text": "Lifetime Tennis, Inc.", "mark": "Lifetime Tennis, Inc."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.49, 0.91, 1.33, 1.43, 1.81, 2.03, 2.11, 2.53, 2.7, 3.24, 3.35]}, {"scene": "rent", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "The auditors found that the operator had understated gross receipts by 310,003 dollars.", "t0": 11.71, "t1": 16.93, "shot": "r3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$310,003", "label": "Underreported gross receipts"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.5, 0.72, 0.85, 1.0, 1.44, 1.58, 2.19, 2.54, 3.1, 3.3, 3.57, 3.86, 4.1, 4.47, 4.69]}, {"scene": "rent", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Those receipts measure business activity at the center.", "t0": 17.05, "t1": 19.47, "shot": "r4", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Gross receipts measure business activity"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.7, 1.04, 1.37, 1.81, 1.92, 2.02]}, {"scene": "rent", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[1]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "The City’s share of the difference was 10,593 dollars in underpaid rent.", "t0": 19.59, "t1": 24.56, "shot": "r5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$10,593", "label": "Rent underpaid during the audit period"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.65, 0.73, 0.83, 1.25, 1.45, 1.74, 2.31, 2.67, 3.0, 3.53, 3.97, 4.16, 4.61]}, {"scene": "rent", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[0]", "established[1]"], "text": "The audit traced the rent difference to receipts the operator had underreported.", "t0": 24.68, "t1": 28.19, "shot": "r6", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "amounts", "context": "The two figures", "heading": "Receipts and rent", "source": "audit", "rows": [{"icon": "money", "label": "Underreported receipts", "value": "$310,003"}, {"icon": "money", "label": "Rent underpaid", "value": "$10,593"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.43, 0.73, 0.85, 1.06, 1.47, 1.61, 2.0, 2.15, 2.61, 2.74]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[0]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "The rent difference fell entirely in the period from April 2022 through March 2023.", "t0": 28.41, "t1": 33.29, "shot": "r7", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office", "text": "Two reporting periods", "mark": "Two reporting periods"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.34, 0.71, 0.91, 1.4, 1.49, 1.59, 1.99, 2.19, 2.57, 2.86, 3.47, 3.74, 4.02, 4.29]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The timing of weather credits and gift certificates explained much of the receipts difference.", "t0": 33.41, "t1": 37.55, "shot": "r8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office", "text": "Weather credits and gift certificates", "mark": "Weather credits and gift certificates"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.44, 0.53, 0.8, 1.17, 1.3, 1.51, 2.43, 2.86, 3.06, 3.14, 3.26, 3.62]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "The auditors also calculated a late charge of 530 dollars.", "t0": 37.67, "t1": 41.3, "shot": "r9", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$530", "label": "Additional late charge"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.56, 0.9, 1.53, 1.61, 1.82, 2.13, 2.26, 2.55, 2.81, 3.07]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[4]"], "text": "Recreation and Park disputed the auditors’ accounting interpretation and agreed to collect the additional revenue.", "t0": 41.42, "t1": 46.73, "shot": "r10", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "The department disputed the interpretation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.65, 0.75, 1.04, 1.47, 1.59, 1.98, 2.42, 3.39, 3.62, 3.9, 3.99, 4.3, 4.41, 4.84]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "The auditors found that the operator materially complied with the agreement overall.", "t0": 46.85, "t1": 50.66, "shot": "r11", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "audit", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office", "text": "Overall material compliance", "mark": "Overall material compliance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.6, 0.87, 1.01, 1.17, 1.7, 2.18, 2.58, 2.72, 2.85, 3.27]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[1]"], "text": "They also found that the department generally fulfilled its oversight obligations.", "t0": 50.78, "t1": 54.43, "shot": "r12", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Department oversight"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.44, 0.68, 0.81, 0.92, 1.38, 1.79, 2.2, 2.37, 2.86]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "Lifetime also submitted revised state sales tax returns through June 2024. The auditors reviewed copies.", "t0": 54.55, "t1": 60.98, "shot": "r13", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "report", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office", "text": "Revised state returns", "mark": "Revised state returns"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.86, 1.31, 1.71, 2.02, 2.35, 2.6, 2.96, 3.2, 3.44, 3.73, 4.9, 5.08, 5.51, 5.83]}, {"scene": "oversight", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The Controller sent the audit to the Board of Supervisors.", "t0": 61.1, "t1": 63.56, "shot": "r14", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "Communication 18", "mark": "Communication 18"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.59, 0.77, 0.89, 1.16, 1.26, 1.36, 1.56, 1.65]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The Board listed the report on its September 2025 agenda.", "t0": 63.78, "t1": 67.01, "shot": "r15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "board", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "September 2, 2025", "mark": "September 2, 2025"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.37, 0.69, 0.8, 1.23, 1.37, 1.5, 1.95, 2.23, 2.73]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "The Controller closed the audit in the first half of 2026 after the recommendations were addressed.", "t0": 67.13, "t1": 71.79, "shot": "r16", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "closure", "kicker": "San Francisco Controller’s Office", "text": "Audit closed", "mark": "Audit closed"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.55, 0.84, 0.96, 1.31, 1.42, 1.52, 1.8, 2.04, 2.15, 2.41, 3.01, 3.26, 3.38, 3.99, 4.12]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "next[0]"], "text": "The public summary gives no subsequent collection date.", "t0": 71.91, "t1": 74.3, "shot": "r17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Collection date", "City ledger entry"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.39, 0.74, 0.96, 1.12, 1.61, 2.04]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["next[0]"], "text": "A remittance and the corresponding rent ledger entry would answer that question.", "t0": 74.42, "t1": 77.69, "shot": "r18", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "A dated payment would close the question"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.6, 0.72, 0.82, 1.43, 1.63, 1.93, 2.19, 2.37, 2.6, 2.76]}, {"scene": "followup", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "Every source is linked in the case file below.", "t0": 77.81, "t1": 79.95, "shot": "r19", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.31, 0.65, 0.8, 1.06, 1.17, 1.26, 1.5, 1.76]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "What the City was owed", "rent": "Where the numbers differ", "oversight": "What the auditors concluded", "followup": "Did the City collect?"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "number"}